0 -16 Td
(3. Detailed Explanations) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Unlike rigid relational tabular models, MongoDB allows each document in a collection to maintain dynamic fields. BSON provides) Tj
0 -12 Td
(efficient binary representation supporting rich data types like Date, ObjectId, and 64-bit integers. The Aggregation Pipeline) Tj
0 -12 Td
(processes document streams sequentially, providing map-reduce capabilities with compiled C++ database engine performance.) Tj
0 -12 Td
