(5. Key Takeaways) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(1. Model data according to application access patterns: data accessed together should generally be stored together.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Use embedding for bounded subdocuments \(e.g. quiz question options\); use referencing for unbounded growing relationships.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Compound index key order matters: follow the Equality, Sort, Range \(ESR\) guideline for optimal index utilization.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. The Aggregation Pipeline provides powerful multi-stage data transformation without client-side computational overhead.) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -7 Td
